<title>USA: Computer Horizons wins AT&amp;T Year 2000 pact.</title>
<headline>Computer Horizons wins AT&amp;T Year 2000 pact.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN LAKES, N.J. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer Horizons Corp said Friday that it has been awarded a &quot;Year 2000&quot; contract by AT&amp;T Corp.</p>
<p>According to the pact, Computer Horizons will provide Year 2000 planning and project management support as well as perform assessment and code repair.</p>
<p>AT&amp;T said its goal is to be compliant by the end of 1998.  </p>
<p>Computer Horizons did not disclose the terms of the deal.</p>
</text>
